    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gujaweeda jea ghaweat fuga mideawa masaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba iita gujaweeda jea ghaweat fuga mideawa masaweega ghaydidi, aba gidaghayi earukusiindi ganiisajeega Galatiya, eara agooga asindunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweeda madeeda aba eawooji ispwa aba jeedeang'wa daba siisi adiing'da gil deena gidamideawa, ak ea mooweamsheeni iyaahiidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda jea dahina, gaydeajeakta fuga jea ageani ghwaat barawajeanda ea haleanjeeda oataydi ak ghwaat gujaweedeang'wa ea ghoahiita Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda iidoabiiw gideaba gaydeadeayi aniini, abeeda gaydeadeayi sea saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Badiida Bawlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gaydabareaseegwa agooga iing'ata beata ng'eanyiida Makedoniya, aba gideaba geagasayi dasigu jeeda ng'eanyiida Makedoniya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwadeepa deabiida heedeang'wa ghana deabiida damanda gooroogeeda, ak abeeda ghoamuuschi aweadaan dalamwajaada aba bareanyeekeasu, aba heeda eagasayi dawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba meagassi dagooneegwa ghamneawa nea ghaang'ati; aba gideaba ghaararji deabiida ng'eang'deang'wa gilinuwaas, iimwas Ng'utamiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghanyi deabiida ng'eanyiida Efeso ea ghwahita damanda ghweelmeeda Bentekosti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba nijaada gidaghuuta muuchi aba gadiyeedeanyu aba hiji, earapeadi saang'a weajoodiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweeda hina Dimoteo, goong'ulayi goobiida heedeang'wa nea mabeala, aba gideaba gwasin gadiyeeda Ng'utamiida gawuurji gideasindi aniini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi adagafool sih niny. Anung' ghwalamwajaada aba bareanyeakaaschi nea ghabeawa hoyyoo, ak abeeda gabiigu heedeanyu; aba gideaba ghaamuughu niny sea fuga eaduupcheewi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu aba iita Apoloheeda was orjeediyya, geamuschi muuchi gabareaseegwa sea fuga eaduupcheewi, nea niny iinyas gheata gayghwaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oang'wearni, nea ghoamiinaadi muuchi aba jeeda masaweegeagwa, adaruusiita nea ghoanyaschi uurda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheegeagwa sean iyoosinyi asina aba bariinyeega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa, fuga eaduupcheewi, agooga ghoanali gideaba ghoah Stefano fuga madeeda gil asheeda gwayamu geat aba ng'eanyiida Akayahi, ak ea niidayda geat aba gadiyeesiinda fuga ghaydidi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geamuscheegwa asisiina mureeda fuga sunu ea heeda siida wassean sin gadiyeeda ea fuga deawiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geahoosanyi aba gideaba nihidu geaba Stefano ea Fotunato ea Akaiko, aba gideaba fiisu nidukuta seawadeeda ang'wearu iimoondani agooga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba ninung' ghahawda guroroodeanyu ea gurooruunatkeagwa. Asi anala muuchi fuga sunu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoaghadeagwa ganiisajeega mida Asiya. Akila sea Briska, sea ganiiseeda mida jeeda gheanyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoaghadeagwa fuga siduupcheewi sean. Oakghada geat aba samooda ghaydit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini Bawlo gil, ak geang'oorneegwa giighadi aba geatindeanyu aniini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida wassean mwabwariinya Ng'utamiida, gagasa eamwaashta. Ng'utamiideanya ghwaan! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dagheerjeanduumeeda Ng'utamiida was Yesu gagasa andeawana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa andeawana bariinyeegeasu oogasean aba jeeda Gristo Yesu. Amin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
